{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "398a62abb39642e2dc3d7772f219055401cb0e9a12241e78224e34bfcf3feaa5", "ja": "夢は、もちろん！", "zh": "梦想当然是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d188909dd37a8ca88f7476e0d4e60a211e668c2976e2822b271b284f6a37176f", "ja": "相変わらずハイペースなレッスンの後、響は\nトップアイドルになれるかもという話から、\nどんなアイドルになりたいかという話題に。\n奈緒は『関西の星』になりたいと答える。\nお互いの共通点に気付く奈緒と響。", "zh": "在一如往常的紧凑训练后，\n众人谈起响说不定可以成为顶尖偶像，\n接着聊到大家想要成为什么样的偶像。\n奈绪表示自己想成为『关西之星』。\n此时奈绪跟响察觉到了彼此的共通点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6384d49210b52c12da9814eb7d4cdd3d6d9eae1351fb8c1473e0cec20bd99e68", "ja": "（今日も、5人での合同レッスンだ。この前は\n皆、響についていけてなかったけど、さて……）", "zh": "（今天也是五人一起的共同训练课程。\n之前大家都跟不上响，不知道今天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "04da1c2904791293c57cf04b1b3c8fd97a206502a791092dd7b81156bcb419f0", "ja": "ほら、見てみてみんな！\nこんな感じで踊るんだぞ！", "zh": "来，大家看本人这里！\n要像这样跳喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "88559d260b15a252cd3329557fce71a6af76be929ea95727298eb3a17a4c107f", "ja": "わぁ、すごーい！　私たちも、\nあれくらい踊れるようになろうね、杏奈♪", "zh": "哇啊，好厉害──！\n我们也要学会跳成那样喔，杏奈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "8634e034bb5d92ea795e28d492d69d3c971be883ef922d5edcc477eddcafff78", "ja": "う、うん……。\nでも……大丈夫、かな……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……\n可是……没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ba28e14a93b4494b932dd3cf5f8ab3eefc83e5e82d6bebd547d59a6f38e188be", "ja": "私も負けてられない……。\n響ちゃんに、ついていかなくっちゃ！", "zh": "我也不能输……\n得跟上响才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1ec3a034f3801d149794bf9553c9e40e0664b5f33d8c6c105825c79fe1334196", "ja": "奈緒、今日のレッスンもビシバシ行くから、\n覚悟しといてよね！", "zh": "奈绪，今天的训练也会很严格，\n要先做好心理准备喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "a69a05c0cdc478acba0afb4b9e0e9ba871ddfb6a7b36931a01621747c29a811b", "ja": "わかってるけど、お手柔らかに頼むで？　最後になって\n全員バラバラやったら、ダンスにならへんからな？", "zh": "知道啦，不过还是请你别逼得太紧喔。\n要不然最后大家程度不一，可就跳不出完整的舞嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "8b9889811338a1f9aee1a875f72a9b43a35197f603024b1092cfb2afe38b44c6", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、奈緒ちゃん♪\nほら、いつも響さんが言ってるでしょ？", "zh": "不要紧的，奈绪♪\n你想想，响不是很常说一句话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "34e24686f04e8570eb446a97671f3f54572e52aff5e0a01062e0262bfb208f01", "ja": "えっと～……あ、そうそう、これ！\nなんとかなるさー！", "zh": "我想想……啊，对对对，就是这句！\n一定能解决啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "66c6d351e1f2231a13e992cd6be4fa90b5dc47fcfb0b83b69e24867684e1afbd", "ja": "ち、違うぞ未来！？\n自分がいつも言ってるのは、なんくるないさー！だぞ！", "zh": "不、不对喔，未来！？\n本人常说的是「总会有办法的啦──！」才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "59bc291a428db3efe7fceb5321cc00383443adb182b15c933106cfd3a0aee2c1", "ja": "そう、それです！　大変なレッスンも、\nみんなでやれば、なんくるないさー！", "zh": "对，就是这句！就算训练很辛苦，\n只要大家同心协力，总会有办法的啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "2d93d039867b9efb2265ba924dda692a46ed71c206c914184bacc838482f1e86", "ja": "もう、未来に言われたらしゃーないなぁ。\nやるだけやってみるわ！", "zh": "吼唷，既然未来都这样讲了，那也没办法啦。\n就尽量试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "22394786d0eb2bc5d43e103a9c7646f3151cc28d97cea8026f818d026c280de8", "ja": "未来、振り付けが全然違うぞ！？\nカチャーシーみたいになってる！", "zh": "未来，你的动作完全错了喔！？\n跳得简直像冲绳手舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "1b3719287b31ac1c5384882c8ca3de16b1720bc8cfa23c323d18bf8111e0dfcd", "ja": "かちゃーしー？", "zh": "冲绳手舞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "7fd053a9031cb5f93c517a58df2fdc01744ec0e73310d86014b6ad425128a39a", "ja": "あ、カチャーシーっていうのは、沖縄の踊りのこと！\n……って、それはおいといて。", "zh": "啊，冲绳手舞是一种冲绳的舞蹈！\n……呃，先别说这个了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "6c7dafd99104d33a147c2e45ceb9fef5aad91267f92edfb5861dc3cca66cc19d", "ja": "奈緒も、ステップ間違ってるぞ！\nミスが多くなってきてるから、集中して！", "zh": "奈绪的舞步也错了喔！\n失误开始变多了，再专心一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "9a0b223ab70b79299c631c2848f966acc6d3291465a9c16c4cb0d97eab8702ae", "ja": "うう、当たってるから何も言い返せへん……。\nこうなったら、関西人の意地、見せたるわ！", "zh": "呜呜，你说的都没错，我完全无法反驳……\n既然如此，我就让你看看关西人的气魄啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "019eaa6421ab3e676e86a5c722b0d3df93965261563588a513832e0813d71c52", "ja": "あははっ、その意気さーっ！\nもっともっと、ペース上げていくぞー！", "zh": "啊哈哈，就是要拿出这种气势啦──！\n本人要再加快速度了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8a88c4ace29efb2d058b294e3fd5ea9091b3e2d85bd1a9c1000da8370d56f0d4", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　今日はここまでにしよう。\n前回より、だいぶ良くなったな！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！今天就到此为止吧。\n跟上次比起来，进步了很多呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "93cfe2c4fdb4ab7f372b61c99d2a875de315bf0fd44616a8fb60a6ecf54b5a46", "ja": "今日のレッスンも楽しかった～♪\nけど、いっぱい踊ったから、ヒザがガクガクする！", "zh": "今天的训练也好开心～♪\n不过跳太多舞了，膝盖都抖个不停！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "fff60476bcb39dcc5a031327ec2569aab96ef497cec3f9587d5ea8fbb2c837c2", "ja": "杏奈も……。筋肉痛に、なりそう……です……。", "zh": "杏奈也是……感觉回去会……肌肉酸痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ca5d88e289228b5c66f64f4fa10b417f27e8f35eb8131ae66d4a983990dcca9", "ja": "帰ったら、ゆっくりお風呂につかろうっと……。\nがんばったご褒美に、高めの入浴剤使っちゃおうかな。", "zh": "回家后泡个舒服的澡吧……\n要不要用高级的入浴剂来犒赏一下自己呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "701d131ea1373a0ce258b98fe16d105b0de8652f177c18409cf191c722028acf", "ja": "みんなヘロヘロやなぁ。私もやけど……。\n疲れを取るには甘いもんや。アメちゃん、食べる？", "zh": "大家都累垮了吼，虽然我也一样……\n甜食可以消除疲劳，要不要吃糖果呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "64dda0b8714689f35b35062b8e7b954ce823a2bba8c1beae88251268c9ebef64", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さんも！\nアメちゃんどうぞ♪", "zh": "来，也有{$P$}先生的份！\n请吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "829bc2df0701fd939c75f3c4f97e0203765e0f8ec5a0af4fe81c53b27a194888", "ja": "お、ありがとう。\n……うん、美味しいアメだな。", "zh": "哦，谢谢。\n……嗯，这糖真好吃啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "459a3d07f0fe1190d455a7a38f702f1d78dfc720c293a8f64dcbe829aaa25d41", "ja": "ありがとう、奈緒ちゃん。\nいただくわ♪", "zh": "谢谢你，奈绪。\n我收下了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "ed0c6ecba589060cc169c9aafac815d3caaf0dde033cdb0b9d73fac18ee3c062", "ja": "奈緒さん……、\nいつも……、アメ、持ってるの……？", "zh": "奈绪……\n你都会……随身带糖果吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "0594b1a1387dec571f2646146cec12aab688872a62edc6f5a7304e18e2e9e2e2", "ja": "大阪人やからな♪　大阪人って優しいんやで？\nそれに、メッチャノリがええねん。", "zh": "因为我是大阪人嘛♪大阪人可是很贴心的喔。\n而且配合度超级高啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "0494dd0f1a437934ede213c6ef56f3ff88dc8f77909ec63f31d5e92285cf4061", "ja": "「バーン！」言われたら、\nどんな時でも撃たれたフリしてくれるし……。", "zh": "无论在什么时候，只要有人对自己说「砰！」，\n都会配合做出被枪击中的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "39b33a204121257ddc04f76e929deca381172416587f07fca4c7ba6e9d5c4f51", "ja": "バーン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "b0bc9f3f801d77697d882000a1b42c2397fac33fc8cd72249ff96ddd5500d6d2", "ja": "うぐっ！　……そうそう、そういうヤツな！\n未来、大阪のノリわかってるやん♪", "zh": "呜呃……！对对，就像这样！\n未来很懂大阪人的反应嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "983c8651685ae89c08c50807479e516299f5da4d903a63f2aeca8b3295d9e06f", "ja": "えへへ、ほんとですか？\n大阪って楽しいな～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的吗？\n大阪好好玩喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e17836161ec44230a9ac5da4ae29c80c0877ef5f02817701d4c08f8d7cde55db", "ja": "それにしても、響ちゃんって、\n本当にダンスが上手よね。", "zh": "话说回来，\n响真的很会跳舞耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "e39649f41718a1959ef8321b4f93e449b0b0d0858a8f62b53b0d2caddf2dfcd4", "ja": "うん……それに、歌も……。\nどうして、そんなに上手……、なの……？", "zh": "嗯……还有，唱歌也……\n为什么会……那么厉害呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "be58fc065ae01f6cc92b72aa8efa50a286eeef6231ce2a4c64ab53deba04c91b", "ja": "へっへーん。自分、カンペキだからね！\nけど、まだまだ満足なんてしてないんだっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为本人很完美啊！\n不过本人还没有满足呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "89bb54f4011dc6dd02e70bdbe4b5313d80ce11f9b99f115bea4d2d9e67772464", "ja": "もっともっとカンペキになって、\n絶対、トップアイドルになってみせるさーっ！", "zh": "本人要变得更加完美，\n绝对要成为顶尖偶像啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "2ecd3b04908138346f6cba1d3386ea9ca591c1b26ea75fb9b9ca821af3ce7beb", "ja": "トップアイドルかぁ……。響はスゴいし、いつか\nホンマにトップアイドルになるかもしれへんな。", "zh": "顶尖偶像吗……响这么厉害，\n搞不好哪天真的能成为顶尖偶像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "379c78ca49ec082923447fee44e9ad63ca4179a7d213515708b6f874d664e14b", "ja": "もちろん、そのためにがんばってるんだぞ！\nねえ、奈緒はどんなアイドルになりたいの？", "zh": "当然，本人就是为了这个目标在努力喔！\n欸，奈绪想成为什么样的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "910bf7b99203df4375cc6f730cdea2efe7d456d070b76be56edc7f114dc5283d", "ja": "えっ、わ、私？　私は、ええと～……\n{$P$}さぁん！", "zh": "咦，我、我吗？我想想……\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e53f91c94006763652a1bd94d213fbb9b289283deeb79f14e9bec0c72d0a319f", "ja": "ん？　そうだな、どんなアイドルでもいいと思うけど、\n例えば……奈緒は、誰に一番見てもらいたい？", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛，我觉得什么样的偶像都很好，\n比方说……奈绪最想让谁看到自己的表现呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "9e63f501be54e79d21f8dbf83e4757d4864d8b5cc6e0ec416286ab7b97809886", "ja": "へ？　誰にって、それは……。ん～。", "zh": "欸？谁喔，这个……嗯～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "35bc29e8cbc3277c7dc1b8ee47794d467b852b01cc80d4adffec569c69b220ce", "ja": "あっ、せや！　思い出した！", "zh": "啊，对了！我想起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "c2ff5de0c7ded41f48cf967eca8a433570e91b22c6ab430772f1026829bd0e77", "ja": "奈緒さん……？", "zh": "奈绪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "236d0266911eb5bb3751fd19f6b60d13b55beb633724621175dbb716a08b21b6", "ja": "ふっふっふ～、みんな聞いて！\n私がなりたいんは、『関西の星』やー！", "zh": "哼哼哼～大家听我说！\n我想成为的是『关西之星』喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ba43f8a12d5982e34c58870a2925813e44413c5a73dec74dca17e380d18b007", "ja": "『関西の星』？", "zh": "『关西之星』？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "0f79cb052747f83b99d00edc69fcfe42167bbfd1607147666126434056d675b5", "ja": "せや！　地元のオバちゃんとか友達とか、\n私のこと、メッチャ応援してくれててな～。", "zh": "没错！我老家那里的大婶、朋友，\n还有好多人都超级支持我的嘿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "3862b9f2e49fb39dd49886d228e6d073a71e1a76baa32f4627b77286173917d5", "ja": "せやから私、めっちゃスゴいアイドルになって、\n地元のみんなの期待に応えたいーっ、とか思てんねん！", "zh": "所以我希望自己可以成为一个超级厉害的偶像，\n好回应乡亲父老的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "93ce49b9a0fb4894e0296d250fc0ba68da23ce5c9548e8f69ac6040f63d91240", "ja": "なるほど、『関西の星』か……奈緒らしいな。", "zh": "原来如此，『关西之星』啊……很有奈绪的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "1fa456e81175a883eb0e5d8eca63765053764cbebe0ab4768164312bf782cb47", "ja": "わかる、わかるぞ奈緒！　自分も、島の期待を\n背負ってるからね。奈緒と一緒さーっ！", "zh": "本人懂，本人感同身受喔，奈绪！\n因为本人也背负着整座岛的期待，跟奈绪一样啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1049_037nao", "source_sha256": "c3c14355856003f45823bf6cc50481b28b7ccc1e3ae69db9f1d4c8cbd9c1b083", "ja": "そうなんや……。案外、私ら似てるとこあるんかもな？\nたしか響って、アニキがおるんやろ？", "zh": "原来是这样……说不定我们两个其实还挺像的？\n我记得响也有哥哥吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1050_013hib", "source_sha256": "c41c4271d0df2684cdb4acdd26388ba1365093265edd8cf44eaf042f239fe4d9", "ja": "うんっ！　にーにーは、島で働いてるぞ。", "zh": "嗯！本人的哥哥在岛上工作喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1051_037nao", "source_sha256": "90f9d70ed506b801ec6909d8a34f7bf06485aa1911787e7c8c50ba4c5d60b96b", "ja": "私も、アニキがいてな～。\n今は東京で一緒に住んでるんやけど……。", "zh": "我也有个老哥呢～\n现在跟我一起住在东京……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "891560a8cd446c3b798f655df813a8c03b2c43c61053782aa8ce80baa0069e92", "ja": "奈緒ちゃんのお兄ちゃんって、\n何かのスポーツ選手なんだっけ？", "zh": "我记得奈绪的哥哥好像是\n什么运动的选手吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1053_037nao", "source_sha256": "485ef2b0f6e4e4f9fee2dba7acd47b9ad5fccdd9a6740fecc15bba56c45b0594", "ja": "そうそう！\nいちおうな、プロのサッカー選手やねん♪", "zh": "没错没错！\n好歹算是一个职业足球选手啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1054_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dffca2263d699b2c32168afab773b79c0e350d5bc49cd5a7231fda0e9c8336d4", "ja": "お兄さんがプロのサッカー選手で、妹がアイドル……\nなんだか、マンガみたいだよね♪", "zh": "哥哥是职业足球选手，而妹妹是偶像……\n总觉得好像漫画的设定呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1055_037nao", "source_sha256": "047d6e9c127adb083f3fb8a4d30c9c973cd9eb2713939d6d6a8889076e4a0f26", "ja": "アハハッ、せやな！　私とアニキ、\n小さいころは、ケンカばっかしてたんやけど……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，真的吼！\n我跟老哥从小就老是吵架，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1056_037nao", "source_sha256": "160142323f05b18f226bba9b28c44dfe4fe8c5f72ef1602fa752baa25629a180", "ja": "今は毎日、朝弱い私の代わりに、朝ご飯作って\nくれんねん。アイドルの仕事も、応援してくれて……。", "zh": "因为我早上起不太来，现在他每天都会帮我做早餐呢。\n而且也很支持我的偶像工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1057_013hib", "source_sha256": "9feba7dca168cd1253ff7f77db697d5b314575b29a7c311aad8aed44e5e9ec76", "ja": "そっかぁ……奈緒のにーにーって、優しいんだねっ！\nえっと、自分のにーにーはね……。", "zh": "是这样啊……奈绪的哥哥很贴心呢！\n唔，本人的哥哥啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "85db1c032b7eb7dee12df5d7955520db57aab9221930c1158ac98eba9154b11e", "ja": "（日常では見逃してしまう、何気ない共通点……\nそれに気付いて、響と奈緒は意気投合したみたいだ）", "zh": "（平常不太会注意到的平凡共通点……\n察觉到这点之后，响跟奈绪好像开始合得来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_03_1059_p", "source_sha256": "af6fc92cf1171a893b3a0f940c477380707a1474234afab56b5f73dc5d06c568", "ja": "（これで、お互いの理解が深まるといいな）", "zh": "（希望经过这次，她们会更加了解彼此。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
